Third-party software dependencies
---------------------------------

apps/web/src/LICENSE.txt is generated as an exact copy of the project LICENSE.
apps/web/src/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt is generated from this project NOTICE plus
a comprehensive inventory of installed third-party packages and the license
and notice documents distributed with them. The web build publishes both files
as downloads from the landing page.

Do not edit generated notices directly. After changing dependencies, run
`npm run licenses:update`, review the result, and commit it with the lockfile.
The normal `npm run audit:licenses` command fails when any generated license
artifact is missing or stale.
